---
/* Slot for the official BBB Accredited Business seal. Paste the seal code from BBB here once Shield is accredited. */
---
<div class="bbb" data-bbb-seal><b>BBB seal</b><span>Official accredited seal goes here</span></div>
<style is:global>
.bbb{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;width:172px;height:60px;padding:0 14px;border:1px dashed var(--rule-strong);border-radius:2px;font-size:.6875rem;line-height:1.35;color:var(--fg-2)}
.bbb b{font-size:.8125rem;color:var(--fg)}
</style>
